<title>USA: Total World Telecommunications names CFO.</title>
<headline>Total World Telecommunications names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total World Telecommunications Inc said on Tuesday its Total National Telecommunications Inc subsidiary named Michael Higgins as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Higgins previously was chief financial officer for U.S. Long Distance Corp.</p>
</text>
